abstract: >
  Reproducible software, configuration, metadata, validation, and generated
  GeoJSON snapshots for official Minnesota precinct boundaries. Boundary
  geometries are obtained from the Minnesota Secretary of State statewide
  GeoJSON source. The project normalizes source fields, derives snapshot
  version and date metadata, validates generated outputs, and produces
  publication-ready precinct boundary artifacts for Civic Interconnect.
  Repository software and documentation are released under the MIT License.

